WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.930
Thinking in four phases helps,

2
00:00:01.930 --> 00:00:05.388
because each one produces
something the next one needs.

3
00:00:05.388 --> 00:00:09.742
The picture earlier showed three; the
guide's routine splits out a fourth,

4
00:00:09.742 --> 00:00:13.588
the close, a few minutes reserved
at the end of the meeting itself.

5
00:00:13.588 --> 00:00:16.265
That's where discussion
turns into decisions

6
00:00:16.265 --> 00:00:18.801
read back and actions
with owners and dates.

7
00:00:18.801 --> 00:00:21.526
Before gives you an agenda
and the right people;

8
00:00:21.526 --> 00:00:25.999
during gives you the discussion and the
decisions; and after puts everything

9
00:00:25.999 --> 00:00:29.913
in writing and carries it into the
next agenda, which closes the loop.

10
00:00:29.913 --> 00:00:34.100
Let's take each phase in turn,
starting before anyone joins.
